==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 15~18 seconds<sup>450f~540f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 85% HP:
**Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 30~35 seconds<sup>900f~1,050f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 70% HP:
**1 [[Pastry Cat (Enemy)|Pastry Cat]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn, delay 55~60 seconds<sup>1,650f~1,800f</sup>.
**3 [[Le'boin]]s spawn, delay 50~55 seconds<sup>1,500f~1,650f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Shy Boy]]s spawn, delay 55 seconds<sup>1,650f</sup>.
**1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns.

==Strategy==
The easiest way to beat this stage without [[Crazed Cats (origin)|Crazed]] or [[:Category:Gacha Cats|Gacha Cats]] is to have all [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal]] and [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cats]] in your lineup with their [[True Form]] (except for [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]], [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|True Valkyrie Cat]], and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]]). Also, you should have [[User Rank]] 1600 to get maxed-out Special Cats.

